{"id":"n23659-1-7","stage":5,"title":"건설업 · 建筑业","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n23659-1-7-1","ko":"건설업에 뛰어들어 보니 어떠세요?","zh":"进入建筑行业后，感觉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"건설업에","meaning":"建筑业","explanation":"건설업：建筑业；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건설업","audio":"/audio/230c0ca627075441a681.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23659","senseId":"1","lemma":"건설업","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"건설업에","audio":"/audio/3e14ca6588ed1d954956.mp3"}},{"text":"뛰어들어","meaning":"进入，涉足，步入","explanation":"뛰어들다：进入，涉足，步入；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"뛰어들다","audio":"/audio/bd1f0cce39e2da6199b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59467","senseId":"4","lemma":"뛰어들다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뛰어들어","audio":"/audio/ae1d3f75d7816c4114f8.mp3"}},{"text":"보니","meaning":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"2","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"보니","audio":"/audio/50ecd95f90550aea6361.mp3"}},{"text":"어떠세요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；으세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떠세요","audio":"/audio/408a5132a57148c800a4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"230c0ca627075441","term":"건설업","zh":"建筑业","audio":"/audio/230c0ca627075441a681.mp3","entryId":"23659","definition":"负责建造楼房或修路等工程及相关业务的产业。","pronunciation":["건ː서럽"]},{"id":"bd1f0cce39e2da61","term":"뛰어들다","zh":"进入，涉足，步入","audio":"/audio/bd1f0cce39e2da6199b2.mp3","entryId":"59467","definition":"积极参与某种事、活动、案件等。","pronunciation":["뛰어들다","뛰여들다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"做过、经历过（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/bfedf9f2afc32b6a157d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n23659-1-7-2","ko":"공사 준비부터 완공까지 생각보다 어려운 일이 많네요.","zh":"从项目筹备到竣工，要做的事情比想象中还要多，相当困难呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"공사","meaning":"工程，施工","explanation":"공사：工程，施工","readings":[{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"23401","senseId":"1","lemma":"공사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"공사","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3"}},{"text":"준비부터","meaning":"准备","explanation":"준비：准备；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"준비","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86434","senseId":"1","lemma":"준비","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"준비부터","audio":"/audio/483efa0dda56e4fc76e4.mp3"}},{"text":"완공까지","meaning":"完工","explanation":"완공：完工；까지：表示终点或范围：“到、直到、连……都”。","readings":[{"term":"완공","audio":"/audio/304219ce4b40570001bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68679","senseId":"1","lemma":"완공","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완공까지","audio":"/audio/c128c39b958da1ba419e.mp3"}},{"text":"생각보다","meaning":"想法，展望","explanation":"생각：想法，展望；보다：比较的基准：“比……”。","readings":[{"term":"생각","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58162","senseId":"6","lemma":"생각","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"생각보다","audio":"/audio/60c489add64a605ce212.mp3"}},{"text":"어려운","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어려운","audio":"/audio/ed94cdbfc6eeac844633.mp3"}},{"text":"일이","meaning":"事情，工作","explanation":"일：事情，工作；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일이","audio":"/audio/deca3bc3889d43a361ec.mp3"}},{"text":"많네요.","meaning":"多，丰富，强","explanation":"많다：多，丰富，强；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"많다","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69295","senseId":"1","lemma":"많다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"많네요","audio":"/audio/5479912738bb2f404d05.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"25e51843741edb40","term":"공사","zh":"工程，施工","audio":"/audio/25e51843741edb403b41.mp3","entryId":"23401","definition":"重新建造或改造设施或建筑物。","pronunciation":["공사"]},{"id":"9ce364fc9c6f2a1c","term":"준비","zh":"准备","audio":"/audio/9ce364fc9c6f2a1ce188.mp3","entryId":"86434","definition":"事先筹备。","pronunciation":["준ː비"]},{"id":"304219ce4b405700","term":"완공","zh":"完工","audio":"/audio/304219ce4b40570001bf.mp3","entryId":"68679","definition":"工程全部做完。","pronunciation":["완공"]},{"id":"6ac12a8f8e4e4c22","term":"생각","zh":"想法，展望","audio":"/audio/6ac12a8f8e4e4c22657b.mp3","entryId":"58162","definition":"想象今后将要发生的事；或指那种想象。","pronunciation":["생각"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事情，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"为了实现某事而使用身体或精神的活动；或指该活动的对象。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"b30b4bf6ab97d6a5","term":"많다","zh":"多，丰富，强","audio":"/audio/b30b4bf6ab97d6a55225.mp3","entryId":"69295","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准。","pronunciation":["만ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/74ecfd0ba8b9eb2d20e9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.444,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/